  "description": "Compute and budget governor-limit consumption per Flow type with worked math: SOQL, DML rows, CPU time, heap. Includes per-entry-point budget tables, cross-automation shared-limit math, and tuning strategies when a flow hits a ceiling. NOT for general bulkification \u2014 use flow/flow-bulkification. NOT for Apex limits \u2014 use apex/governor-limits.",
